\title{RLVM agentic journal}

\p{Working notes for RLVM (Rabdos Lean VM), a checker for the Lean 4 kernel on GraalVM. Agents and the maintainer record design notes, decisions, measured findings, open problems, examples and dated changelog entries here as small trees that link to each other.}

